# MFE boundaries

- Host owns chrome, session, and tokens. Remotes expose only `./Mfe`.
- Envelope must not contain `accessToken` / `refreshToken`. Remotes use `capabilities.api.request`.
- Local remotes load from MED0003 `dist` via `/__mfe/<name>/mf-manifest.json`.
- Do not create `apps/shell` in MED0003. Do not accept remote URLs from query params.
